  f('C.1','SHM displacement and velocity',t`x=x_0\sin(\omega t+\phi),\qquad v=\omega x_0\cos(\omega t+\phi)`,'The velocity leads displacement by π/2 in this sine convention. The phase constant sets the starting state.', t`x|displacement|m;x_0|amplitude|m;v|velocity|m s⁻¹;\omega|angular frequency|rad s⁻¹;t|time|s;\phi|initial phase|rad`,10);
