  f('D.1','Newton’s gravitation law',t`F=G\frac{m_1m_2}{r^2}`,'For point masses or non-overlapping spherical bodies. The force is attractive and r is centre-to-centre separation.', t`F|gravitational force magnitude|N;G|gravitational constant|N m² kg⁻²;m_1,m_2|masses|kg;r|centre-to-centre distance|m`,12);
