  f('D.2','Work and electric potential',t`W=q\Delta V_{\rm e}`,'External work for a slow displacement, or the change in electric potential energy. Work done by the field is its negative.', t`W|external work or potential energy change|J;q|signed test charge|C;\Delta V_{\rm e}|final minus initial electric potential|V`,12);
