  r('C.2','Intensity and amplitude',t`I=\frac{P}{A},\qquad I\propto a^2`,'For the same wave type, medium, frequency and other conditions, intensity is proportional to amplitude squared. Do not confuse intensity I with electric current.', t`I|wave intensity|W m⁻²;P|power crossing the area|W;A|area perpendicular to propagation|m²;a|wave amplitude|depends on wave type`);
